The fastloess C++ library is available through the vcpkg-specific CMake package:

    find_package(unofficial-fastloess CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::fastloess::fastloess)

Include <fastloess.hpp> to use the C++17 interface.
The curated Linux port selects glibc binaries and checks the target compiler during configuration. Musl users need an overlay port.